        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>As a Free Action at the start of combat, the Aberrant may choose one allied Genestealer Cults Leader within Medium Range and become their guardian, and are considered to be defending them for the duration of the combat (IM CRB pg. 207). If the target is attacked and the Aberrant is within Medium Range, they can immediately move to Defend them. If doing so causes the Aberrant to break Engagement, their opponents have Disadvantage on their Melee Attack.</p>"
